From: gts7l project
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: s5k3m5: fix the crop rectangle's height

s5k3m5_get_selection() reports the mode's width as the height of the
crop and crop-bounds rectangles, so the 4208x3120 mode claims a
4208x4208 crop. Report the height.

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/s5k3m5.c b/drivers/media/i2c/s5k3m5.c
index c591b580d..fe040302c 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/s5k3m5.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/s5k3m5.c
@@ -1052,7 +1052,7 @@ static int s5k3m5_get_selection(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
 		sel->r.left = 0;
 		sel->r.top = 0;
 		sel->r.width = s5k3m5->mode->width;
-		sel->r.height = s5k3m5->mode->width;
+		sel->r.height = s5k3m5->mode->height;
 		return 0;
 	default:
 		return -EINVAL;
